{"id":"vod_bf_20620","vodId":"20620","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"邻座的怪同学 动画版","name_cn":"邻座的怪同学 动画版","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-21/51ebf969ac46881cc6a33bacfd2d5f83.jpg"},"summary":"作为学校成绩名列前茅的水谷雫（户松遥 配音），实际上却有着和可爱外表超级不相配的冷漠性格。在她的眼里，将书读好，把钱赚够，这就是她梦寐以求的生活，至于其它的一切，都不过是会干扰她向目标迈进的浮云罢了。就是这样的雫，居然接到了一个非常棘手的麻烦——去给学校闻名遐迩的不良少年吉田春（铃木达央 配音）送讲义！　　虽然初次的相处并不愉快，但随着接触的深入，雫发现，吉田春并不如表面上所看到的那样乖僻的粗暴，正相反，在他高大的躯壳里，居然藏着一颗害怕伤害他人的善良的心。因为害怕伤害，所以索性就全然拒绝，这就是吉田的处事哲学。而对于吉田来说，曾经看不上眼的优等生雫，也有着天真和细腻的一面。这样的两人在误解中渐渐的相互吸引着，再加上周围一帮稀奇古怪的损友们，甜蜜又青涩的校园恋爱剧就此拉开序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 07:00:17","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/linzuodeguaitongxuedonghuaban/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/linzuodeguaitongxuedonghuaban/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/linzuodeguaitongxuedonghuaban/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/linzuodeguaitongxuedonghuaban/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/linzuodeguaitongxuedonghuaban/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/linzuodeguaitongxuedonghuaban/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/linzuodeguaitongxuedonghuaban/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/linzuodeguaitongxuedonghuaban/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/linzuodeguaitongxuedonghuaban/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/linzuodeguaitongxuedonghuaban/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/linzuodeguaitongxuedonghuaban/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"